# Build context for hq/Dockerfile and field/Dockerfile (repo root). Dependencies are installed
# inside the image from the lockfile; nothing local or secret goes in.
**/node_modules
**/.data
**/.nuxt
**/.output
**/dist
**/.env*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.git
.github
.claude
demo/recordings
docs
infra
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars
